"text": "[image] 2. Email your Neighbors Personal notes win elections. Click this box to open up a template email in your email app (or copy the template below). Personalize it and send it to your friends and neighbors in the district!",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Why+I%E2%80%99m+voting+for+Melissa+Hernandez+on+August+18&body=Hi+%5BName%5D%2COn+August+18%2C+our+district+will+hold+a+special+election+to+fill+Eric+Swalwell%E2%80%99s+former+seat+in+Congress%2C+and+I+wanted+to+share+why+I%E2%80%99m+voting+for+Melissa+Hernandez.Melissa+is+the+daughter+of+migrant+farmworkers+and+a+single+mom+who+put+herself+through+college.+As+Mayor+of+Dublin%2C+she+didn%E2%80%99t+just+talk+about+our+challenges+%E2%80%94+she+solved+them%3A+building+new+housing%2C+creating+good+jobs%2C+and+delivering+for+families+like+ours.+That%E2%80%99s+why+every+mayor+in+the+district+is+backing+her.Three+quick+ways+to+help%3A-+Vote+early.+Ballots+arrive+in+your+mailbox+soon+%E2%80%94+return+yours+by+mail%2C+drop+box%2C+or+in+person.-+Tell+a+neighbor.+Turnout+in+summer+specials+is+low%2C+so+every+vote+counts.-+Volunteer+at+MelissaHernandez2026.com.Special+elections+are+decided+by+who+shows+up.+I+hope+you%E2%80%99ll+join+me+in+voting+for+Melissa.%5BYour+Name%5D"
